sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor P as Purchasing Staff
  participant Adm as Admin (Flutter Web)
  participant API as API (NestJS)
  participant Pur as Purchasing Service
  participant Inv as Inventory Service
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Aud as Audit Log

  P->>Adm: New Purchase Invoice (select supplier)
  P->>Adm: Add items (product, qty, unit cost, LOT, expiry)
  Adm->>API: POST /purchase-invoices
  API->>Pur: Validate & create invoice
  Pur->>DB: INSERT purchase_invoice + items
  P->>Adm: Receive goods to warehouse/location
  Adm->>API: POST /purchase-invoices/{id}/receive
  API->>Inv: For each item -> create batch
  loop Each invoice item
    Inv->>DB: INSERT inventory_batch (cost, lot, expiry, qty)
    Inv->>DB: INSERT batch_stock (batch, location, qty)
    Inv->>DB: INSERT stock_movement (type=PURCHASE, +qty)
  end
  Inv->>Aud: Log receipt (who, what, cost)
  Inv-->>API: Batches created & located
  API-->>Adm: Invoice posted, stock updated
  Adm-->>P: Show batches + locations + landed cost
